        {"id": "88-sleeve", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-12bf9f583ccbd9ca3465ba4f.txt", "line_start": 397, "line_end": 397, "quote": "宝钗前头补过的那件衣裳又穿了几回，袭人收来，先看袖口针脚没有松，才放到可洗的一包里。"},
        {"id": "88-habit-break", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-12bf9f583ccbd9ca3465ba4f.txt", "line_start": 431, "line_end": 431, "quote": "宝玉从里间出来，衣襟有一粒扣未扣好，袭人照旧伸手，手到半途却停住，向麝月道扣子在那一侧，别错扣到旁边眼上。"},
        {"id": "88-married", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-12bf9f583ccbd9ca3465ba4f.txt", "line_start": 433, "line_end": 433, "quote": "蒋玉菡在两家已说定的安排下与袭人成了婚，礼毕回到新住的屋子，他先问那只包搁哪里。"},
        {"id": "88-return", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-12bf9f583ccbd9ca3465ba4f.txt", "line_start": 441, "line_end": 441, "quote": "袭人见她转身，临走向宝玉说：“好歹留着麝月。”"},
        {"id": "88-remote-death", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-12bf9f583ccbd9ca3465ba4f.txt", "line_start": 459, "line_end": 459, "quote": "王夫人道：“我们自己的姑娘，竟只给一句没了？”"},
        {"id": "88-no-access", "path": "artifacts/agent_research/reading/set-m4-v1/public/read-12bf9f583ccbd9ca3465ba4f.txt", "line_start": 465, "line_end": 465, "quote": "车还停着，去问的人没有带回可见的答复，尸身也仍在孙家。"},
